<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Dashboard — Earbud·EEG</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Condensed:wght@400;500;600&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=Roboto+Mono:wght@400&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <style>
      :root {
        --void: #0b0b0b;
        --panel: #15171a;
        --panel-2: #1c1f23;
        --line: rgba(206, 206, 206, 0.12);
        --line-strong: rgba(206, 206, 206, 0.22);
        --pure: #ffffff;
        --fog: #cecece;
        --ash: #8a8d91;
        --gold: #d9963f;
        --gold-soft: rgba(217, 150, 63, 0.14);
        --teal: #189b81;
        --cond: "Barlow Condensed", system-ui, sans-serif;
        --sans: "Inter", system-ui, sans-serif;
        --mono: "Roboto Mono", ui-monospace, monospace;
        --sidebar-w: 248px;
      }
      * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
      body {
        background: var(--void);
        color: var(--pure);
        font-family: var(--sans);
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      }
      a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
      ::selection { background: var(--gold); color: var(--void); }

      .app { display: flex; min-height: 100vh; }

      /* ---------- Sidebar ---------- */
      .sidebar {
        position: fixed;
        top: 0; left: 0; bottom: 0;
        width: var(--sidebar-w);
        border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
        background: #0e1012;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        padding: 22px 16px;
        z-index: 20;
      }
      .brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 11px; padding: 4px 8px 22px; }
      .brand svg { width: 22px; height: 22px; }
      .brand b { font-family: var(--cond); font-weight: 600; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; }
      .brand b span { color: var(--gold); }

      .nav { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }
      .nav a {
        display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;
        padding: 11px 12px; border-radius: 9px;
        font-size: 14px; color: var(--ash);
        transition: background 0.18s, color 0.18s;
      }
      .nav a svg { width: 18px; height: 18px; opacity: 0.8; }
      .nav a:hover { background: var(--panel); color: var(--fog); }
      .nav a.active { background: var(--gold-soft); color: var(--pure); }
      .nav a.active svg { opacity: 1; stroke: var(--gold); }

      .side-foot { margin-top: auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; }
      .help-card {
        border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px;
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--gold-soft), rgba(28,31,35,0.2));
      }
      .help-card h4 { font-family: var(--cond); font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.02em; }
      .help-card p { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--ash); margin: 6px 0 12px; line-height: 1.45; }
      .logout { font-size: 13px; color: #e06b6b; padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 8px; }
      .logout:hover { background: rgba(224, 107, 107, 0.1); }

      /* ---------- Main ---------- */
      .main { flex: 1; margin-left: var(--sidebar-w); min-width: 0; }
      .topbar {
        position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 15;
        display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
        padding: 16px 28px;
        background: rgba(11, 11, 11, 0.82); backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      }
      .topbar h1 { font-family: var(--cond); font-weight: 500; font-size: 26px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.01em; }
      .topbar__right { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; }

      .btn {
        font-family: var(--cond); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.03em; text-transform: uppercase;
        padding: 9px 18px; border-radius: 1440px; cursor: pointer; border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
        background: transparent; color: var(--pure); transition: all 0.2s; display: inline-block;
      }
      .btn:hover { border-color: var(--pure); }
      .btn--primary { background: var(--gold); border-color: var(--gold); color: var(--void); }
      .btn--primary:hover { background: #e6a85a; border-color: #e6a85a; }

      .user { position: relative; }
      .user__chip {
        display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; cursor: pointer;
        padding: 7px 8px 7px 14px; border-radius: 1440px; border: 1px solid var(--line);
      }
      .user__chip:hover { border-color: var(--line-strong); }
      .user__name { font-size: 13px; color: var(--fog); }
      .user__avatar { width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--gold); color: var(--void); display: grid; place-items: center; font-family: var(--cond); font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; }
      .user__menu {
        position: absolute; top: 115%; right: 0; min-width: 180px;
        background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden;
        opacity: 0; visibility: hidden; transform: translateY(8px); transition: all 0.2s; z-index: 50;
      }
      .user__menu.show { opacity: 1; visibility: visible; transform: translateY(0); }
      .user__menu a { display: block; padding: 12px 16px; font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--fog); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
      .user__menu a:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
      .user__menu a:hover { background: var(--panel-2); color: var(--pure); }

      .content {
        padding: 28px;
        display: block;
        max-width: 960px;
      }
      .col { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 22px; min-width: 0; }

      .panel { background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; }
      .panel__eyebrow { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold); }
      .panel__title { font-family: var(--cond); font-weight: 500; font-size: 24px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.01em; margin-top: 8px; }
      .panel__desc { font-size: 14px; color: var(--ash); line-height: 1.55; margin-top: 8px; max-width: 60ch; }

      /* Get-started steps */
      .steps__head { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
      .progress { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; color: var(--ash); }
      .bar { height: 5px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--panel-2); margin: 18px 0 22px; overflow: hidden; }
      .bar > span { display: block; height: 100%; width: 33%; background: var(--gold); border-radius: 999px; }
      .step { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; padding: 13px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
      .step:first-of-type { border-top: none; }
      .step__dot {
        width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 50%; flex-shrink: 0;
        display: grid; place-items: center; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); color: var(--ash);
      }
      .step.done .step__dot { background: var(--teal); border-color: var(--teal); color: #04120e; }
      .step.active .step__dot { border-color: var(--gold); color: var(--gold); }
      .step__body { flex: 1; }
      .step__body strong { font-family: var(--cond); font-weight: 500; font-size: 17px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.01em; display: block; }
      .step__body span { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--ash); }
      .step .btn { padding: 7px 14px; }

      /* Forms */
      .field { margin-bottom: 16px; }
      .field label { display: block; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ash); margin-bottom: 8px; }
      .field input {
        width: 100%; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 14px;
        background: var(--panel-2); border: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--pure); font-family: var(--sans);
      }
      .field input:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--gold); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--gold-soft); }
      .form-actions { margin-top: 20px; display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; }

      /* Resources */
      .resources { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px; }
      .res {
        border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 14px; padding: 18px; background: var(--panel);
        transition: border-color 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
      }
      .res:hover { border-color: var(--line-strong); transform: translateY(-3px); }
      .res .k { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; color: var(--gold); letter-spacing: 0.06em; }
      .res h3 { font-family: var(--cond); font-weight: 500; font-size: 18px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 10px 0 6px; }
      .res p { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--ash); line-height: 1.5; }

      @media (max-width: 1040px) {
        .resources { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      }
      @media (max-width: 760px) {
        .sidebar { transform: translateX(-100%); }
        .main { margin-left: 0; }
        .resources { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        .topbar { padding: 14px 16px; }
        .content { padding: 16px; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <%
      var initial = (userName && userName.length) ? userName.trim().charAt(0).toUpperCase() : 'U';
    %>
    <div class="app">
      <!-- ---------- Sidebar ---------- -->
      <aside class="sidebar">
        <a class="brand" href="/dashboard">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M12 0 L14 10 L24 12 L14 14 L12 24 L10 14 L0 12 L10 10 Z" fill="#ffffff" />
            <path d="M12 7 L13 11 L17 12 L13 13 L12 17 L11 13 L7 12 L11 11 Z" fill="#d9963f" />
          </svg>
          <b>EARBUD<span>·</span>EEG</b>
        </a>

        <nav class="nav">
          <a class="active" href="/dashboard">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2z"/><path d="M9 22V12h6v10"/></svg>
            Home
          </a>
          <a href="#analyze-card">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 12h4l3 8 4-16 3 8h4"/></svg>
            Analyze EEG
          </a>
          <a href="/waitlist?feature=prediction">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2a7 7 0 00-4 12.7V18a2 2 0 002 2h4a2 2 0 002-2v-3.3A7 7 0 0012 2z"/><path d="M9 22h6"/></svg>
            Predict seizures
          </a>
        </nav>

        <div class="side-foot">
          <div class="help-card">
            <h4>Hardware access</h4>
            <p>Live analysis and seizure prediction need the Earbud EEG hardware kit first.</p>
            <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/waitlist?feature=hardware">Join waitlist</a>
          </div>
          <a class="logout" href="/logout">Log out</a>
        </div>
      </aside>

      <!-- ---------- Main ---------- -->
      <div class="main">
        <header class="topbar">
          <h1>Home</h1>
          <div class="topbar__right">
            <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/waitlist?feature=analysis">Join waitlist</a>
            <div class="user" id="user">
              <div class="user__chip" id="userChip">
                <span class="user__name">Welcome, <%= userName %></span>
                <span class="user__avatar"><%= initial %></span>
              </div>
              <div class="user__menu" id="userMenu">
                <a href="/dashboard">Dashboard</a>
                <a href="/waitlist?feature=prediction">Predict seizures</a>
                <a href="/logout">Log out</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </header>

        <div class="content">
          <div class="col">
            <!-- Get started -->
            <section class="panel steps">
              <div class="steps__head">
                <div>
                  <p class="panel__eyebrow">You're almost set</p>
                  <h2 class="panel__title">Get your first reading</h2>
                </div>
                <span class="progress">1 / 3 complete</span>
              </div>
              <div class="bar"><span></span></div>

              <div class="step done">
                <span class="step__dot">✓</span>
                <div class="step__body">
                  <strong>Account created</strong>
                  <span>You're signed in and ready to go.</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="step active">
                <span class="step__dot">2</span>
                <div class="step__body">
                  <strong>Join the hardware waitlist</strong>
                  <span>Buy the Earbud EEG hardware first, then live capture can be enabled.</span>
                </div>
                <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/waitlist?feature=analysis">Join waitlist</a>
              </div>
              <div class="step">
                <span class="step__dot">3</span>
                <div class="step__body">
                  <strong>Unlock seizure prediction</strong>
                  <span>Prediction is blocked until hardware access is available.</span>
                </div>
                <a class="btn" href="/waitlist?feature=prediction">Join waitlist</a>
              </div>
            </section>

            <!-- Analyze -->
            <section class="panel" id="analyze-card">
              <p class="panel__eyebrow">Hardware required</p>
              <h2 class="panel__title">Patient EEG analysis is blocked</h2>
              <p class="panel__desc">
                Live EEG analysis needs the Earbud EEG hardware kit before the
                app can collect recordings, filter signals, and generate reports.
              </p>
              <div class="lock-note">Blocked until hardware purchase</div>
              <div class="form-actions">
                <a href="/waitlist?feature=analysis" class="btn btn--primary">Join analysis waitlist</a>
              </div>
            </section>

            <!-- Predict -->
            <section class="panel">
              <p class="panel__eyebrow">Hardware required</p>
              <h2 class="panel__title">Seizure prediction is blocked</h2>
              <p class="panel__desc">
                Seizure prediction is currently reserved for the hardware-enabled
                workflow. Join the waitlist so access can be opened once the kit is ready.
              </p>
              <div class="lock-note">Blocked until hardware purchase</div>
              <div class="form-actions" style="justify-content: flex-start; margin-top: 18px">
                <a href="/waitlist?feature=prediction" class="btn btn--primary">Join prediction waitlist</a>
              </div>
            </section>

            <!-- Resources -->
            <section class="resources">
              <article class="res">
                <span class="k">01</span>
                <h3>What ear-EEG measures</h3>
                <p>In-ear electrodes pick up temporal-lobe activity, close to the regions tied to memory and attention.</p>
              </article>
              <article class="res">
                <span class="k">02</span>
                <h3>Reading the bands</h3>
                <p>Delta, theta, alpha, beta and gamma power reveal calm, focus, drowsiness and abnormal spikes.</p>
              </article>
              <article class="res">
                <span class="k">03</span>
                <h3>Placing the earbud</h3>
                <p>A snug fit keeps the dry electrode in steady contact, which keeps the signal clean and stable.</p>
              </article>
            </section>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <script>
      // user dropdown
      (function () {
        var chip = document.getElementById("userChip");
        var menu = document.getElementById("userMenu");
        if (chip && menu) {
          chip.addEventListener("click", function (e) {
            e.stopPropagation();
            menu.classList.toggle("show");
          });
          document.addEventListener("click", function () { menu.classList.remove("show"); });
        }
      })();
      // smooth scroll for in-page anchors
      document.querySelectorAll('a[href^="#"]').forEach(function (a) {
        a.addEventListener("click", function (e) {
          var el = document.querySelector(this.getAttribute("href"));
          if (el) { e.preventDefault(); el.scrollIntoView({ behavior: "smooth", block: "start" }); }
        });
      });
    </script>
    <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
